    "We need to create a TSV file that looks like this:\n",
    "\n",
    "`term     sem                KeyBERT`\n",
    "\n",
    "`CD28_lex G#protein_molecule 0.3333333333333333`\n",
    "\n",
    "`and                         1.0`\n",
    "\n",
    "The first line is the header.\n",
    "The second line is an example of what happens with a gold standard technical term.\n",
    "The third line is an example of what happens with a non-technical term.\n",
    "\n",
    "Practicalities\n",
    "1. Gold standard technical terms are located here: '../1-preprocessing/GENIAcorpus3.02-keywords.tsv'\n",
    "2. To match technical terms, we need to take some careful steps.\n",
    "   Example 1: 'cd28' matches 'CD28_lex'\n",
    "   Example 2: 'il-2_gene' matches 'IL-2_gene_lex'"
